==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈfɹiːləʊdə(ɹ)/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who does not [[contribute]] or [[pay]] appropriately; one who gets a [[free ride]], etc. without paying a fair share.
#: {{syn|en|free rider|moocher|Thesaurus:scrounger}}
# {{lb|en|UK|NZ|Canada}} An individual who takes expired unsold merchandise from the back of supermarket premises.

